      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what do you mean by \"goblin's resolve\" or anything about \"goblin lore\"? I just need the actual math for the deflection. Can you just give me the calculation for the L/360 limit on that 4x12 beam so I can see if it actually passes code?",
